flowchart TD
    A([Page loads]) --> B[fetch GET /admins]
    B --> C{response}
    C -- error --> D[page-level error banner]
    C -- success --> E[render admin table\ncurrentAdmin parsed from sessionStorage]

    E --> F{currentAdmin.role?}
    F -- super_admin --> G[Invite button visible\nDeactivate/Reactivate/Reset visible per row]
    F -- platform_admin --> H[Invite button visible\nDeactivate/Reactivate visible per row\nReset hidden]
    F -- other/missing --> I[read-only table]

    G --> J([Invite admin])
    J --> K[InviteModal opens\nname + email + role select + password]
    K --> L[POST /admins]
    L -- 201 --> M[setAdmins prepend new row\nclose modal]
    L -- error --> N[inviteError in modal]

    G --> O([Deactivate row])
    H --> O
    O --> P[ConfirmModal opens\naction=deactivate]
    P --> Q[PATCH /admins/:id/deactivate]
    Q -- 200 --> R[update row isActive=false in state]
    Q -- error --> S[per-row actionError]

    G --> T([Reactivate row])
    H --> T
    T --> U[ConfirmModal opens\naction=reactivate]
    U --> V[PATCH /admins/:id/reactivate]
    V -- 200 --> W[update row isActive=true in state]
    V -- error --> X[per-row actionError]

    G --> Y([Reset password])
    Y --> Z[ResetPasswordModal opens]
    Z --> AA[POST /admins/:id/reset-password\nbody: {newPassword}]
    AA -- 200 --> BB[5s resetSuccess chip in row]
    AA -- error --> CC[resetError in modal]
